            <tr class="border-b border-ink-200/50 dark:border-ink-800/60"><td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-[0.8rem]">@gotgenes/pi-permission-system</td><td class="py-2"><span data-lang="en">allow / ask / deny gates over tools, bash, MCP, and paths. STEP 9 configures it.</span><span data-lang="ko">도구·bash·MCP·경로에 allow/ask/deny 관문. 설정은 STEP 9.</span></td></tr>
