            <tr class="border-b border-ink-200/50 dark:border-ink-800/60"><td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-[0.8rem]">@samfp/pi-memory</td><td class="py-2"><span data-lang="en">Persistent facts, preferences, and lessons across sessions.</span><span data-lang="ko">세션을 넘어 남는 사실·선호·교훈 저장소.</span></td></tr>
